<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Tong Yang Confectionery H1 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Tong Yang Confectionery H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   987  vs 597</p>
<p>    Net					  4.23  vs 2.54</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			6.10  vs 3.65</p>
<p>    Revenue				  203.48  vs 189.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Tong Yang Confectionery Co Ltd is one of South Korea's leading confectioners which produces a range of cookies, snacks and chewing gums. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
